{"id":"b88a00a8db9c1c07","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-ce-indexing.md","title":"Enumerated Domains","display":"df-ce-indexing — Enumerated Domains","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-ce-indexing","aliases":["90-df-ce-indexing"],"display":"df-ce-indexing — Enumerated Domains","depends_on":["[[90-df-ce-set]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-ce-indexing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-ce-indexing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-indexing — Enumerated Domains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"548e36d75578d019\" href=\"?note=548e36d75578d019\" title=\"90-df-ce-set\">90-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>给定正元数候选编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，其一元分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_1:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal{PF}_1\">\\(\\Phi_1:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal{PF}_1\\)</span>。定义域索引总能定义；只有相应有效性、覆盖性成立时才推出可枚举性与覆盖全部 c.e. 集。</li>\n<li>无上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 在每次调用中使用已经固定的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>；本书原程序编号文件将它实例化为自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span>。本文件不预选其它程序的数值枚举。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nW_e^\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_1(e))\\quad(e\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nW_e&amp;\\coloneqq W_e^\\Phi,\\\\\n\\operatorname{EffNum}_1(\\Phi_1)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{CE}(W_e^\\Phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\{W_e^\\Phi:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathcal{CE},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ A=W_e^\\Phi\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nW_e^\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_1(e))\\quad(e\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nW_e&amp;\\coloneqq W_e^\\Phi,\\\\\n\\operatorname{EffNum}_1(\\Phi_1)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{CE}(W_e^\\Phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\{W_e^\\Phi:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathcal{CE},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ A=W_e^\\Phi\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 有效通用求值固定 e 后仍是部分可计算函数；覆盖性则由所选编号覆盖全部一元部分递归函数得到。阶段近似仍使用原文件的历史码界，不在这里另设时钟。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"548e36d75578d019","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_1:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal{PF}_1","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nW_e^\\Phi&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_1(e))\\quad(e\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nW_e&\\coloneqq W_e^\\Phi,\\\\\n\\operatorname{EffNum}_1(\\Phi_1)&\\Longrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{CE}(W_e^\\Phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\{W_e^\\Phi:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathcal{CE},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AcceptNum}(\\Phi)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ A=W_e^\\Phi\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_e$ 取 [[90-df-ce-indexing]] 在本书固定编号上的定义域实例。零元输入使用空元组，但编号族 $\\Phi$ 仅收集 $k\\ge1$ 的正元部分。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[90-df-ce-indexing]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["548e36d75578d019","1802adc1900d4b34"]}